/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The Hult Prize Foundation is a disruptive global leader in social entrepreneurship and youth empowerment for the 21st century. The Hult Prize has brought impact focused programs, events, and training to over a million students globally from 120+ countries, creating a pathway for youth everywhere to take action to build a better world. Each year, tens of thousands of university students from dozens of countries participate, and since its inception, participants have represented 5,000+ institutions of higher education.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [0]
>>
